{"id":93,"date":"2026-06-21T14:17:00","date_gmt":"2026-06-21T12:17:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jdworld-os.netbird.cloud\/?p=93"},"modified":"2026-10-27T03:52:42","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T02:52:42","slug":"jdwos-ff-stm","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/jdwos-packages\/mr_jack\/93\/","title":{"rendered":"JDWOS-FF-STM (FastFetch Custom)"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"862\" height=\"608\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-ff-hard.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-306\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-ff-hard.png 862w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-ff-hard-300x212.png 300w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-ff-hard-768x542.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 862px) 100vw, 862px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Terminale Avanzato e Profili Fetch Custom<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Questo pacchetto integra l\u2019emulatore di terminale <strong>Kitty<\/strong>, i <strong>Nerd Fonts<\/strong> e configura 4 profili grafici intercambiabili di <strong>Fastfetch<\/strong> con citazioni dinamiche ad ogni avvio.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica del Pacchetto<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Name<\/strong>: JDWorld OS Fastfetch Custom (<strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-color\">jdwos-ff-stm.jdw<\/mark><\/strong>)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Architecture<\/strong>: Nativa Indipendente (.jdw)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Distro<\/strong>: Arch Linux<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>License(s)<\/strong>: Simplified BSD License<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Maintainers<\/strong>: JDWorld<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Package Size<\/strong>: 12.4 KB<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Build Date<\/strong>: 2026-06-21<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Update Date<\/strong>: 2026-07-15<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83e\uddf0 Dipendenze Richieste<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Il sistema provveder\u00e0 a scaricare automaticamente dai repository ufficiali puri di Arch:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><code>kitty<\/code> (Emulatore di terminale)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><code>fastfetch<\/code> (Motore di estrazione dati)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><code>ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols-common<\/code> (Icone e glifi per i profili)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><code>ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd<\/code> (Icone e glifi per i profili)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><code>ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols<\/code> (Icone e glifi per i profili)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Istruzioni di Installazione rapida<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Grazie al nuovo <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/JDWorld\/jdwos-pm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JDWorld OS Package Manager Universale<\/a><\/strong>, puoi installare questo pacchetto direttamente dal cloud senza scaricare nulla a mano. Apri il terminale e digita:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"\">sudo jdw-install jdwos-ff-stm<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Per la rimozione chirurgica:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"\">sudo jdw-remove jdwos-ff-stm<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Nel caso preferite scaricare il pacchetto .jdw, per installarlo apri il terminale e digita:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"\">sudo jdw-install jdwos-ff-stm.jdw<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udcbe Download Diretto del Binario<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/JDWorld\/jdwos-repo\/releases\/download\/latest\/jdwos-ff-stm.jdw\">Scarica il pacchetto binario jdwos-ff-stm .jdw<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udd04 Profili di Switch inclusi nel terminale e nel STM:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><code>fastfetch<\/code> &#8211; Profilo <strong>Full Custom<\/strong> (Default)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><code>ff-hard<\/code> &#8211; Profilo incentrato sull\u2019<strong>Hardware<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><code>ff-soft<\/code> &#8211; Profilo incentrato sul <strong>Software<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><code>ff-stock<\/code> &#8211; Profilo <strong>Stock<\/strong> pulito senza fronzoli<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anteprima<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Profilo: fastfetch<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"877\" height=\"696\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-fastfetch.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-305\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-fastfetch.png 877w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-fastfetch-300x238.png 300w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-fastfetch-768x609.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 877px) 100vw, 877px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Profilo: ff-hard<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"862\" height=\"608\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\